    "3f7abce2": {
      "text": "The school is planning a garden party. The date in the reading is 26 September.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 9.8527,
      "duration": 5.056,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "bc706370": {
      "text": "What will happen on the sports field? There will be traditional games. Children can try Chinese yo-yo, kite-flying, dragon dance and tug of war.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 15.2587,
      "duration": 8.8107,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "2fe71c38": {
      "text": "You can try a game and stamp your card. Then you can get a prize. Come and have a go!",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 24.4193,
      "duration": 4.7787,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "2f3814cb": {
      "text": "The invitation ends with a friendly idea: Let's have fun together.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 29.548,
      "duration": 4.0747,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "544c81af": {
      "text": "The children watch Mr Zhong practise kung fu. He introduces changquan. In the lesson, changquan is described as the mother of many kung fu styles.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 33.9727,
      "duration": 9.6853,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "d95937c7": {
      "text": "Mr Zhong talks about twelve kinds of actions. He shows one and asks the children what it looks like. They think of a tree.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 44.008,
      "duration": 7.4027,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "2178c927": {
      "text": "Stand like a pine tree. The children stand straight and strong. A picture in your mind can help you remember the action.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 51.7607,
      "duration": 7.2747,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "3d9fe659": {
      "text": "Sit like a bell. This is another way to use a familiar shape to describe an action. What does this look like? Think before you answer.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 59.3853,
      "duration": 7.7227,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "edb549cf": {
      "text": "Mr Zhong moves as fast as the wind. He explains that he uses all his strength for each action. That is why he moves so fast.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-02.mp3",
      "start": 67.458,
      "duration": 8.576,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "c5cebe28": {
      "text": "The Dragon Dance Club is getting ready for the garden party. Its members are practising together.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-03.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 5.504,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "a1ffbc17": {
      "text": "Minmin is at the head of the dragon. He runs too fast. At the tail, Xiaopu calls out, but the others can't keep up with Minmin.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-03.mp3",
      "start": 5.854,
      "duration": 8.0213,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "fb1cc1b6": {
      "text": "Minmin can't hear the call because the music is loud. He runs faster, and the students at the tail lose control of their sticks.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-03.mp3",
      "start": 14.2253,
      "duration": 7.7227,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "10d416b1": {
      "text": "Mr Zhong stops the practice. Everyone needs to work as a team. Minmin should follow the music, and the others should follow him.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-03.mp3",
      "start": 22.298,
      "duration": 7.872,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "a1cd12e0": {
      "text": "They try again and keep the same pace. Now the dragon moves smoothly. Keeping together makes the difference.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-03.mp3",
      "start": 30.52,
      "duration": 6.5067,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "b9f6b0f4": {
      "text": "Start your game introduction with its name. For example: Kite-flying is my favourite traditional game.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-03.mp3",
      "start": 37.3767,
      "duration": 6.0587,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "a61d0527": {
      "text": "Next, explain what you need and how to play. A kite and a windy day are useful for kite-flying. You can run and watch the kite rise.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-03.mp3",
      "start": 43.7853,
      "duration": 8.5547,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "3dc1c4ee": {
      "text": "Finish with a reason and an invitation. You might say that the game is exciting. Invite your friends to have a go.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-03.mp3",
      "start": 52.69,
      "duration": 7.0613,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
