      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "3a82a940": {
      "text": "Here is an action clue: he helps teachers clean the blackboard. This is one reason to call him helpful.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-05.mp3",
      "start": 47.7667,
      "duration": 5.9733,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "92475a4c": {
      "text": "He also helps other students learn English. A useful clue tells us who he helps and what he helps them do.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-05.mp3",
      "start": 54.09,
      "duration": 6.3573,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "925d2b37": {
      "text": "Someone guesses Wenwen, but the answer is James. James is surprised to discover that the clues are about him.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-05.mp3",
      "start": 60.7973,
      "duration": 6.848,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "49d30be7": {
      "text": "James watches his classmates skip with a long rope. It seems difficult, and he does not feel confident.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-05.mp3",
      "start": 67.9953,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "f782e539": {
      "text": "Minmin gives him a helpful instruction: wait for the rope to come down, then jump over it. A clear step can make a hard task easier.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-05.mp3",
      "start": 74.7453,
      "duration": 8.4267,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "cc6e8041": {
      "text": "When James sees the rope coming, he ducks away. He is still afraid of it.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-05.mp3",
      "start": 83.522,
      "duration": 4.2453,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "9a9daf23": {
      "text": "Shenshen and Xiaojiang encourage James and turn the rope more slowly. They change the task to help him try again.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 7.36,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "28fab342": {
      "text": "This time, James jumps in and keeps skipping. Everyone cheers. He feels excited and thanks his classmates.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 7.71,
      "duration": 6.5707,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "84866a71": {
      "text": "To write a classmate riddle, begin with a personal quality and give an action as evidence. For example, a helpful classmate may help you draw.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 14.6307,
      "duration": 8.704,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "4d9e18e9": {
      "text": "Add a skill and a dream. She may be good at painting pictures and want to be a painter. Keep the name secret until others guess.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 23.6847,
      "duration": 7.5733,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "5bbd3621": {
      "text": "In this extra story, Duck, Dog and Tortoise take part in a swimming match after class.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 31.608,
      "duration": 5.3547,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "49a9ca6e": {
      "text": "Dog makes a fast start, then gets tired. Tortoise moves slowly and falls behind.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 37.3127,
      "duration": 5.3333,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "a80632a2": {
      "text": "Duck swims well and encourages the other two swimmers. In the story, he has plenty of energy.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 42.996,
      "duration": 5.8027,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "5220b6a9": {
      "text": "Duck wins, but the friends celebrate all three swimmers. Winning is one achievement; trying and supporting others matter too.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 49.1487,
      "duration": 7.5093,
      "speed": 0.94,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "027ef893": {
      "text": "Here are my lovely classmates.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 57.008,
      "duration": 1.7493,
      "speed": 0.92,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "4a16b095": {
      "text": "She wants to be a painter.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 59.1073,
      "duration": 1.5147,
      "speed": 0.92,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "673e79c1": {
      "text": "She is good at painting pictures.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 60.972,
      "duration": 1.8347,
      "speed": 0.92,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "bed8c141": {
      "text": "She often helps friends.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 63.1567,
      "duration": 1.536,
      "speed": 0.92,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "70ef3073": {
      "text": "He helps teachers clean the blackboard.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 65.0427,
      "duration": 2.0907,
      "speed": 0.92,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    },
    "e5cd0ddf": {
      "text": "I see him playing football.",
      "lang": "en",
      "file": "unit2-06.mp3",
      "start": 67.4833,
      "duration": 1.6213,
      "speed": 0.92,
      "listened": false,
      "contentReview": "pending"
    }
  },
